OL,3,GNEWSAHusband and wife died from impact
OL,4,Atrauma in plane crash, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has opened into the deaths
OL,7,Fof a husband and wife who died in a
OL,8,Fplane crash.
OL,10,FSheetal Swali and Ketan Swali from
OL,11,FSyston, Leicester, were pronounced dead
OL,12,Fat the scene after a light aircraft
OL,13,Fthey were in was found at a remote
OL,14,Flocation close to Trawsfynydd, Gwynedd.
OL,16,FAir and ground searches were carried
OL,17,Fout to find the plane after police were
OL,18,Ftold just after 12:00 BST on Friday
OL,19,Fthat an aircraft had not arrived at
OL,20,FCaernarfon Airport as scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
